          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "The attack spell that is targeted with this spell must make an RR (using its caster's level as its level). If the RR succeeds, it will attack its original target as intended; otherwise, the effects of that spell are delayed for 1 round. After 1 round, if the target of the held spell has moved more than 20', the held spell may randomly affect another target within 10' of the original target point. If not cast upon the original target, Basic attack spells will suffer a special modification of -20 and Elemental attack spells suffer a special modification of -30."
        }
